{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"compacted_at":1788078281477904611,"compiled_state":{"alias":"crashing-arachnidan-impala","assignee":null,"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","authorship":{"signed":2,"unsigned":0},"authorship_ledger":[{"content_hash":"bf8e9144e07d198d1e79a1b6e9cacd2b6734ea8e44924b0429d74c452dfbff73","event_uuid":"91f344cc-08bb-432a-b60a-ec7988b3870f","position":{"commit_sha":"c769fde0052aaa2ee802ab73bfe54bc2558fee3c","position":"1788074078329802001-91f344cc-08bb-432a-b60a-ec7988b3870f"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"3f42d97034f2e1866a9e6455306447647634a5c2a3c5311fd6b7ee7b408b01d3","event_uuid":"a73bea91-1939-437c-8dbc-2d81ecd172f1","position":{"commit_sha":"743d41ab90e3dfcc1f113a37f15a381ae612017e","position":"1788074089267052001-a73bea91-1939-437c-8dbc-2d81ecd172f1"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1788074078329802001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"a73bea91-1939-437c-8dbc-2d81ecd172f1","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"3405-c0b7-0436-4b46"}],"description":"test_export_ndjson_js_safe.py::test_export_timestamps_round_trip_exactly is a\ndata-dependent flake (~1/256 of runs).\n\nRoot cause: the test uses the `ns_ticket` fixture, whose created_at/updated_at are\nwall-clock nanosecond epochs (magnitude ~1.79e18). The test's load-bearing premise is\n`assert int(float(expected)) != expected` — i.e. it REQUIRES the stored ns timestamp to\nbe float64-INEXACT so it can prove the string emission (vs a naive float) matters. But\nnear 1.79e18 the float64 grid spacing (ULP) is 256, so ~1 in 256 wall-clock ns values are\nexactly float64-representable; when the fixture happens to draw such a value the premise\n`int(float(x)) != x` is False and the test fails with\n\"stored updated_at <n> survives a float64 round-trip; the hazard is undemonstrable\".\nObserved on Gerrit 2419 patchset-2 CI (run 33297528057, py3.12): stored updated_at\n1788072768731609344 round-trips exactly. Deterministically reproducible by feeding a\nfloat64-exact ns timestamp.\n\nUnrelated to the error-code taxonomy epic (this test polices NDJSON timestamp export\nJS-safety; the epic touches error-code classification). Discovered here only because the\nepic's CI runs the full suite.\n\nSuggested fix (own scope): make the hazard deterministic instead of relying on a\nwall-clock draw — construct the ticket/export fixture with a timestamp KNOWN to be\nfloat64-inexact (e.g. a large ns value with low bits set, asserted `int(float(v)) != v`\nat fixture-build time), OR if the drawn value is float64-exact, skip/redraw. Do NOT weaken\nthe lossless-string assertion; only fix the premise's data dependency.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"d101-729a-9f10-438b","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Flaky test_export_timestamps_round_trip_exactly: data-dependent float64-exact ns timestamp","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["91f344cc-08bb-432a-b60a-ec7988b3870f","a73bea91-1939-437c-8dbc-2d81ecd172f1"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788078281477904611,"uuid":"aafa79ae-212a-483f-b2eb-6a6b34e5e53c"}